    <string name="calibration_guided_start">Start guided calibration</string>
    <string name="calibration_guided_instructions">Hold the phone at arm\'s length in front of a straight edge (a door frame or table edge works well). Adjust zoom and offset until the edge lines up through the gap around the phone.</string>

